{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-as-a-study-tool","title":"第一章 AI 作为学习工具","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/ai-usage/ai-as-a-study-tool","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"concept-breakdown","title":"大学 AI 使用 — 课程概念拆解：把\"听不懂\"变成\"问得出\"","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/ai-usage/ai-as-a-study-tool/concept-breakdown","wordCount":1597,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"ai-practice-partner","title":"大学 AI 使用 — AI 陪练：用对话方式刷题","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/ai-usage/ai-as-a-study-tool/ai-practice-partner","wordCount":1477,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"cross-disciplinary-exploration","title":"大学 AI 使用 — 跨学科探索：突破专业壁垒","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/ai-usage/ai-as-a-study-tool/cross-disciplinary-exploration","wordCount":1697,"readingTime":7},{"seq":4,"slug":"personal-knowledge-system","title":"大学 AI 使用 — 构建个人知识体系：AI + 笔记的组合","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/ai-usage/ai-as-a-study-tool/personal-knowledge-system","wordCount":1656,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第一章-ai-作为学习工具-简介\">第一章 AI 作为学习工具 简介</h1><p>我大一的高数期中考前两周，发现微分方程那一章自己根本听不懂。教材翻三遍、同学讲两次都没救——最后我打开 ChatGPT，把&quot;为什么齐次方程要做 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = vx</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 这个换元&quot;这一个问题，来回追问了七轮。第七轮我突然懂了，那种&quot;懂了&quot;的感觉，比刷十道题都扎实。从那以后我才意识到：AI 不是用来&quot;代替学习&quot;的，它是用来<strong>陪你想清楚</strong>的。</p>\n<p>这一章讲怎么把 AI 用作大学课程学习的辅助工具——不是抄答案的工具，是帮你学得更深的工具。我们覆盖四个最常见的学习场景：理解抽象概念、刷题、跨学科探索、构建个人知识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章包含的文档\">本章包含的文档</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>课程概念拆解：把&quot;听不懂&quot;变成&quot;问得出&quot;</strong> — 学会把模糊的&quot;我没听懂&quot;拆成可问的具体问题</li>\n<li><strong>AI 陪练：用对话方式刷题</strong> — 不是看答案，而是让 AI 当你的对手陪你想</li>\n<li><strong>跨学科探索：突破专业壁垒</strong> — 工科生想学一点经济、文科生想懂一点编程</li>\n<li><strong>构建个人知识体系：AI + 笔记的组合</strong> — 让 AI 帮你把零散笔记整理成结构</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"学完之后\">学完之后</h2><p>你会发现以前两小时刷完没消化的内容，现在用 AI 对话式学习能压缩到 40 分钟、并且记得更牢。更重要的：你会建立一种&quot;先自己想 → 再问 AI → 再质疑它的回答&quot;的认知节奏，这是后面三章的基础。</p>\n"}